#
# Counter-example for the `math:` expression lowering
# (crates/logic/src/physical/lower.rs,
# MathLoweringError::OccurrenceMissingDeclaredVariable): a math:VariableExpression root
# whose single math:VariableOccurrence names NO math:declaredVariable at all. Distinct
# from tests/counter-examples/variable-occurrence-unscoped.ttl (a standalone,
# unreferenced math:VariableOccurrence authored purely to trip the SHACL shape — never
# reached by the lowering, since a bare math:VariableOccurrence is not one of the four
# recognized expression-root types): THIS fixture wires the occurrence under a real
# math:VariableExpression root, so the native lowering actually reaches and rejects it.
# The authored math:structuralKey lets the reasoned-graph gate
# (check_structural_key_on_rejected_expression) also reach it.
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/> .

ex:root a math:VariableExpression ;
    math:variableOccurrence ex:occ ;
    math:structuralKey "not-a-real-digest" .

ex:occ a math:VariableOccurrence .
